USCSandbox: name the sampled texture after the resource operand, not the sampler.

When two textures share one sampler (the directional lightmap: unity_LightmapInd and
unity_Lightmap both use s0), both reads came out as unity_Lightmap. Seen in the game's
Shader Forge/Object, Hair and Lunacid/Mix; checked against the DXBC (t4 then t3).

Licence: GPL-3.0, like USCSandbox (https://github.com/nesrak1/USCSandbox).

